```

What is printed by the recursive countdown method call `countdown(3)`?

```java
public static void countdown(int num) {
    if (num <= 0) {
        System.out.print("End");
    } else {
        System.out.print(num + " ");
        countdown(num - 1);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the recursive decimal-to-binary method `decToBin(13)`?

